As you continue to attune your body to undeath you reject nature as a whole.

As long as you have no natural infusion on your skin, each rune on it increases your minimum negative life by [-8, -15, -21, -25, -30 (TL1-5)] and your spells critical chance by [1.0%, 1.3%, 1.5%, 1.6%, 1.8% (TL1-5)].

